ACT XIX OF 2017
ACT XIX
OF 2017
ILMA
UNIVERSITY ACT, 2016
An Act to provide for up gradation of the Institute
of Business and Technology to the status of the ILMA University at Karachi
[Gazette
of Sindh Extraordinary, Part IV, 11th May, 2017]
NO.PAS/Legis-PB-11/2016, dated
11.5.2017.---The ILMA University Bill, 2016 having been passed by the
Provincial Assembly of Sindh on 18th April, 2017 and
assented to by the Governor of Sindh on 08th May,
2017 is hereby published as an Act of the Legislature of Sindh.
Preamble.---WHEREAS
it is expedient to provide for up-gradation of the Institute of Business and Technology
to the status of the ILMA University at Karachi and to provide for matters
ancillary thereto;
It is hereby enacted as follows:-
CHAPTER-I
PRELIMINARY
2. Definitions.---In
this Act, unless there is anything repugnant in the subject or context:-
(a) "Academic
Council" means the Academic Council of the University;
(b) Affiliated
Institution or College means an educational institution or college affiliated
to the University but not maintained or administered by it;
(c) "Authority"
means any of the Authorities of the University specified in section 16;
(d) Board"
means the Board of Governors of the University;
(e) Chairman
means the Chairman of the Board;
(f) "Chancellor"
means the Chancellor of the University;
(g) College
means a college and includes an institution in which arrangement exist for
imparting instructions in general, technical professional education or other
disciplines of higher learning and such other subjects as may be prescribed;
(h) Constituent
or institution college means an institution or college maintained and
administered by the University;
(i) "Dean" means the Head of
Faculty;
(j) Director
means the head of a teaching or administrative division of an institute;
(k) Faculty
means a Faculty of the University;
(l) Government
means the Government of Sindh;
(m) Head
mean the Head of the Teaching Department;
(n) HEC
means Higher Education Commission, Government of Pakistan;
(o) "Officer
means and of the officers of the university specified in section 5;
(p) "Patron"
means the Patron of the University;
(q) "Prescribed
means prescribed by statutes, regulations or rules;
(r) Pro-Vice
Chancellor means the Pro-Vice Chancellor of the University;
(s) Professor
Emeritus means a retired Professor working in the University in an honorary
capacity;
(t) "Registrar"
means the Registrar of the University;
(u) Society
means the Global Educational Consultants Society registered under the Society Registration
Act, 1860 vide registration No: KAR No: 195 of 2001 dated 06-10-2000;
(v) "Statutes ,
regulations and rules" means respectively the statutes, regulations and
rules made under this Act;
(w) "Teaching
Department" means a Teaching Department of the University;
(x) "Teacher"
means whole time teacher engaged as Professor, Associate Professor, Assistant
Professor, Lecturer and such other persons as may be declared to be the
Teachers;
(xi) "University"
means the ILMA University established under this Act;
(xii) Vice
Chancellor means the Vice Chancellor of the University.
